@format 1
@id project.load-scene
@title Load named scene
@area Project
@entry input
@summary Confirm replacement of the current window and rebuild it from one stored named scene.
@flow TB
@related project.save-scene, project.import-scene

@alias console = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PConsole
@alias scene = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LScene

[input] Load scene requested <input>
- Receive a selected scene and check unsaved divergence @ console.PConsoleLoadHandle(...)
> confirm

[confirm] Confirm replacement <decision>
- Ask before replacing a materially different current scene @ console.PConsoleSceneConfirm(...)
? "User declines" > unchanged
? "Load proceeds" > read

[read] Read and apply scene <process>
- Read the named scene from persistent collection @ scene.LSceneRead(...)
- Rebuild the window from the scene and set it active @ console.PConsoleSceneLoad(...)
> result

[result] Scene loaded <output>
= The window reflects the selected named scene.

[unchanged] Current scene retained <output>
= The visible window is unchanged.
